  "_comment": [
    "The files of the dataset deposit (Zenodo draft 23183438), read by kit/export/deposit.internal.py. Internal: never exported.",
    "An entry with sha256 is an archive or a sample: it is found by its SHA-256 under the directory given with --from, whatever",
    "its local name. An archive's label is the first cell of its row in the table Deposits of its record (before ' ('); a",
    "sample's label is its condition, a word on the line of its record that gives its SHA-256 (one SHA-256 per line). An entry",
    "with repo is a file of this directory, read from the committed version. sha256 null means pending: not yet packed or",
    "recorded. The Windows entries were filled in on the Windows measuring machine on 2026-10-06 (experiment/data.windows.md); the",
    "candidates that failed the check are not listed and their reasons are in that record. The SHA-256 of conditions.txt of each",
    "condition is recorded for Windows; for macOS it is recorded by the session on the macOS machine."
  ],
